msgid ""
"Use AOL proxy server instead of direct connections. If you are behind a "
"router that you do not control, you will probably want this."
msgstr ""
"En AOL-Proxyserver bruken, keen Direktverbinnen. Sittst Du achter en "
"Nettweger, den Du nich instellen kannst, is dat en goot Idee."

