#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The Skype plugin serves as a bridge to an externally running copy of "
#| "Skype. This has some consequences on how it functions: you need an "
#| "instance of Skype to be running, and only one Skype account can be used."
#| "<br /><br />Note that you need to install the original dynamic linked "
#| "Skype version 2.0 or 2.1 from <a href=\"http://www.skype.com\">http://www."
