#| "client set to english. Kopete show notifications (incomming call, "
#| "message, ...), so you can turn off Skype notifications"
msgid ""
"The Skype plugin serves as a bridge to an externally running copy of Skype. "
"This has some consequences on how it functions: you need an instance of "
"Skype to be running, and only one Skype account can be used.<br /><br />Note "
"that you need to install the original dynamic linked Skype version 2.0 or "
"2.1 from <a href=\"http://www.skype.com\">http://www.skype.com</a><br /><br /"
">This plugin will only work if the language in the Skype client set to "
"English. Kopete shows notifications (incoming call, message, ...), so you "
"can turn off the notifications in Skype."
msgstr ""
"Dat Skype-Moduul is en Brüchprogramm na en extern lopen Skype. Dorüm mutt "
"Skype ok al lopen, un Een kann bloots een Skype-Konto bruken.<br /><br /"
">Beacht, Du muttst dat orginale, dünaamsch linkte Skype in de Verschoon 2.0 "
"oder 2.1 vun <a href=\"http://www.skype.com\">http://www.skype.com</a> "
"installeren.<br /><br />Dit Moduul funkscheneert bloots, wenn de Skype-"
"Client op de engelsche Spraak instellt is. Kopete wiest Bescheden (Anroop, "
"Naricht, ...), Du kannst also Skype sien Bescheden utmaken"

